<div class="row media-showcase">
  <!-- left column  -->
  <div class="col-sm-6">
    <div class="content-block">
      <h2>Preview Settings</h2>
      <div>This is a BETA page to customize initial preview settings. For now, you can set the initial model rotation and save annotations. Changes will be displayed with the preview for all users. Here's how to do it:</div> 
      <div class="mt-1">1. Configure desired scene settings using the viewer. You may want to expand the viewer to full screen. Open the tools menu. Use rotation controls to set custom rotation. Create annotations by navigating to the annotation tab and double-clicking on the model. For each annotation you can customize the title, description, and default view.</div>
      <div class="mt-1">2. Once you have the desired scene settings, export scene settings from the viewer with the button below. Changes will be stored when the media record is saved.</div>
      <div class="mt-1">Please note: Rotation will be applied to the model behind the scenes, details of custom rotations will not appear in the rotation controls within the viewer. Rotations are applied to original model position and subsequent changes are not cumulative.</div>
      
      <div class="mt-2">
        <a id="request-iframe-json-emit" href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Export viewer scene settings</a>
      </div>

      <!-- rotation -->
      <div class="form-group row mt-2">
        <div class="col-xs-6 showcase-label">
          <label class="control-label string optional" for="media_preview_rotation">Rotation</label>
          <i class="material-icons tooltip-icon" data-original-title="" title="">
            <p class="hint hide"><%= t('simple_form.hints.defaults.preview_rotation') %></p>
          </i>
        </div>
        <div id="media_preview_rotation" class="col-xs-6 showcase-value">--</div>
      </div>

      <!-- annotations -->
      <div class="form-group row">
        <div class="col-xs-6 showcase-label">
          <label class="control-label string optional" for="media_preview_annotations">Annotations</label>
          <i class="material-icons tooltip-icon" data-original-title="" title="">
            <p class="hint hide"><%= t('simple_form.hints.defaults.preview_annotations') %></p>
          </i>
        </div>
        <div id="media_preview_annotations" class="col-xs-6 showcase-value">--</div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-2">
        <%= render_edit_field_partial('aleph_scene', f: f) %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- right column  -->
  <div class="col-sm-6">
    <div class="content-block preview">
      <%= render @presenter.showcase_viewer_partial, presenter: @presenter %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>